course: dictionary
lesson: 8445
title: One word, two meanings: saffron
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one is meant. Saffron can be a spice you eat, or a deep orange-yellow colour. Look at the sentence around it to decide.
explain: In «Spices come from every part of a plant: pepper is a berry, saffron is the red threads in a crocus flower, and cinnamon is curled-up tree bark.», the sentence is about where spices come from. Saffron is in a list of spices, so here it means the spice. The clues are the words spices, plant and crocus flower.
explain: When a sentence talks about food, a colour or a gold shade, check which meaning fits. Swap your meaning into the sentence and see if it still makes sense. If you read «the saffron robes», the clue is the word robes, which tells you the colour is meant.
fact: Saffron is a spice made from the dried red-orange threads of a crocus flower.
fact: Saffron gives food a golden colour and a special taste.
fact: Saffron is also a deep orange-yellow colour, so it can be an adjective, as in «saffron-yellow».
fact: Saffron is the most expensive spice in the world by weight.
fact: Each crocus flower gives only three tiny threads, and they are picked by hand.
exercise: «Saffron is the red threads in a crocus flower.» Where does saffron come from, according to the sentence? | A chilli pepper | *A crocus flower | A berry | Tree bark
exercise: Ruby says her new scarf is saffron-yellow. What does saffron mean in that sentence? | A kind of tea | A spice you can cook with | *A deep orange-yellow colour | A type of rice
exercise: Why is saffron so expensive? | *Each flower gives only three tiny threads, and they are picked by hand | It only grows on the moon | Shops charge extra for it on Mondays | It is made from gold
test: Which dish uses saffron? | *Paella | Toast | Jelly
test: In religion lessons, what colour are the robes many Buddhist monks wear? | Black | *Saffron-orange | White
exam: «Saffron is the most expensive spice in the world by weight.» What is the main reason? | *Only three tiny threads come from each flower, and they are picked by hand | Monks buy all of it | It is mined from deep under the ground | It is rare because it only grows in one shop
